      "writtenOn": "2016-10-06T20:19:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, but only if the new fields are added to the bottom. If you stick them in the middle, you need to keep track of each version\u0027s structs and cast the data returned to the correct type.",
      "parentUuid": "7fd2c819_2a71c335",
      "revId": "f995ba48f8f61ef7b6dc97bd69966288143cce7c",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
